* EVENT TO DATABASE for ChipStart, Finish, and course splits
EVENT TO DATABASE
EVENT               CHIPSTART
EVENT FIELD         CHIPSTART
TIME FORMAT         HH:MM:SS.01

EVENT TO DATABASE
EVENT               FINISH
EVENT FIELD         FINISH
TIME FORMAT         HH:MM:SS.01

